### Start a game
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "Little Hero",
  "animal": "PANDA",
  "difficulty": "MEDIUM",
  "mode": "NORMAL"
}

> {% client.global.set("gameId", response.body.sessionId); %}

### Get current state
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}

### Move one tile
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "RIGHT"
}

### Use the buddy ability
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "USE_ABILITY"
}

### Drop a banana decoy
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "DROP_BANANA"
}

### Leaderboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/leaderboard?limit=10

### Today's medium daily challenge leaderboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/leaderboard?limit=10&mode=DAILY&difficulty=MEDIUM

### Game options
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/game-options

### Abandon game
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}
